{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\u2694\ufe0f The tactical roguelite that doesn\u2019t forgive mistakes</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to <i>The Tower of Shadows</i>, a brutal turn\u2011based roguelite where every floor rewrites the rules of combat. Think you know tactical RPGs? The Tower is here to prove you wrong.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\ud83c\udff0 A living tower that wants you dead</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every ascent is a new fight against a structure that constantly shifts:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Changing rules</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unpredictable curses</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Adaptive enemies</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unique rewards</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No two runs are the same. No mistake goes unnoticed.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\ud83e\udde0 Tactical combat that demands real decisions</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There\u2019s no button\u2011mashing here. Every action is a gamble. Every tile matters. Your heroes survive only if you master:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Class synergies</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Smart positioning</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tight resource management</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enemy weaknesses</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you fall, it\u2019s because the Tower outplayed you \u2014 not because of luck.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\ud83e\uddd9 Build a team capable of surviving the impossible</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Recruit, upgrade, combine. Each hero brings a unique playstyle, and the strongest teams are often the ones you never expected to work.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\ud83d\udc80 Death isn\u2019t the end \u2014 it\u2019s your teacher</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You will die. A lot. But every defeat unlocks new options, new strategies, and new ways to break the Tower.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\ud83c\udf11 A dark fantasy atmosphere that pulls you in</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore a cursed tower consumed by Shadows. Face its guardians, uncover its secrets\u2026 And survive long enough to learn what waits at the top.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\ud83d\udee0\ufe0f Early Access: you\u2019re not just a player \u2014 you\u2019re a builder</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your feedback directly shapes:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Balancing</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >New heroes</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Additional floors</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Advanced mechanics</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Join the first explorers of the Tower. Help forge a tactical roguelite built for players who want a real challenge.</p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"The Corridors of the Dungeon","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3767720/b5c6b7c630c498e8c75761fc25797723ff270a8b.jpg"},{"name":"The Warehouse ","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3767720/39baa0175fd1f85f1a9bd9962d740669d4ba4f85.jpg"},{"name":"Wine cellar","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3767720/ddeccb559f9c8e76c8c45c8746919e2af5b222ac.jpg"},{"name":"The tavern","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3767720/fcb2d3da08ff8ecc7a79211d7a805b7de7bdffac.jpg"},{"name":"The Neighborhoods","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3767720/0176867b0a4c1dca675887549d3af55d0477cd6f.jpg"},{"name":"The Statues of the Ancients","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3767720/a71c50250df0a2bb863eb33ed801a5d514cb21b3.jpg"},{"name":"The forge","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3767720/4b40f909a51bb